---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// HOSE trading hours and price step for ordinary stocks (HOSE "Quy dinh giao dich", Apr 2025;
// same hours and steps in the HOSE note of Feb 2026). Tick as a share of price = tick / price x 10,000 bps (python).
const W = 900, H = 424, X0 = 40, PX = 820 / 345; // px per minute from 09:00
const seg = (a: number, b: number) => ({ x: X0 + a * PX, w: (b - a) * PX });
const segs = [
  { ...seg(0, 15), en: 'ATO', vi: 'ATO', t: '09:00', kind: 'call', types: 'LO, ATO' },
  { ...seg(15, 150), en: 'Continuous matching I', vi: 'Khớp lệnh liên tục I', t: '09:15', kind: 'cont', types: 'LO, MTL' },
  { ...seg(150, 240), en: 'Lunch break', vi: 'Nghỉ trưa', t: '11:30', kind: 'rest', types: '' },
  { ...seg(240, 330), en: 'Continuous II', vi: 'Liên tục II', t: '13:00', kind: 'cont', types: 'LO, MTL' },
  { ...seg(330, 345), en: 'ATC', vi: 'ATC', t: '14:30', kind: 'call', types: 'LO, ATC' },
];
const ticks = [
  { price: 8000, tick: 10, bps: 12.5 }, { price: 9990, tick: 10, bps: 10.0 }, { price: 10000, tick: 50, bps: 50.0 },
  { price: 25000, tick: 50, bps: 20.0 }, { price: 49950, tick: 50, bps: 10.0 }, { price: 50000, tick: 100, bps: 20.0 },
  { price: 100000, tick: 100, bps: 10.0 },
];
const fmt = (n: number) => n.toLocaleString('en-US');
const fmtVi = (n: number) => n.toLocaleString('en-US').replace(/,/g, '.');
---
<figure class="f">
  <div class="f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: the HOSE trading day. An opening call auction from 09:00 to 09:15 (ATO), continuous matching from 09:15 to 11:30, a lunch break until 13:00, continuous matching from 13:00 to 14:30, and a closing call auction from 14:30 to 14:45 (ATC). Bottom: the price step as a share of price. At 8,000 dong the step of 10 dong is 12.5 basis points; at 9,990 it is 10; at 10,000 the step jumps to 50 dong, which is 50 basis points; at 25,000 it is 20; at 49,950 it is 10; at 50,000 the step is 100 dong, 20 basis points; at 100,000 it is 10.">
    <DiagramIcon name="clock" x={24} y={20} size={22} />
    <text x="46" y="26" class="f-h"><tspan data-lang-en>A HOSE day, and how coarse the price grid is</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một ngày giao dịch trên HOSE, và lưới giá thô đến đâu</tspan></text>
    {segs.map((s) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={s.x} y="86" width={s.w} height="44" rx="4" class={s.kind === 'call' ? 'f-ask' : s.kind === 'cont' ? 'f-bid' : 'f-empty'} />
        {s.w > 60 && <text x={s.x + s.w / 2} y="113" text-anchor="middle" class="f-qty"><tspan data-lang-en>{s.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi}</tspan></text>}
        {!['09:15','14:30','09:00'].includes(s.t) && <text x={s.x} y="78" class="f-sub">{s.t}</text>}
        {s.types && <text x={s.t === '09:00' ? s.x : s.w > 60 ? s.x + s.w / 2 : s.x + s.w} y="150" text-anchor={s.w > 60 ? 'middle' : (s.t === '09:00' ? 'start' : 'end')} class="f-faint">{s.types}</text>}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={X0} y="78" class="f-sub">09:00–09:15</text>
    <text x={X0 + 345 * PX} y="78" text-anchor="end" class="f-sub">14:30–14:45</text>
    <text x={X0 + 2} y="172" class="f-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Red: call auctions (one price for everyone). Green: continuous matching. LO limit order, MTL market order.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đỏ: khớp định kỳ (một giá cho tất cả). Xanh: khớp liên tục. LO lệnh giới hạn, MTL lệnh thị trường.</tspan></text>

    <text x={X0} y="214" class="f-ann"><tspan data-lang-en>The price step as a share of the price (basis points, 1 bp = 0.01%)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bước giá tính theo phần trăm của giá (điểm cơ bản, 1 bp = 0,01%)</tspan></text>
    {ticks.map((t, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x={X0 + 100} y={246 + i * 24} text-anchor="end" class="f-price"><tspan data-lang-en>{fmt(t.price)}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{fmtVi(t.price)}</tspan></text>
        <rect x={X0 + 112} y={231 + i * 24} width={t.bps * 9} height="18" rx="3" class={t.bps === 50 ? 'f-ask' : 'f-bid'} />
        <text x={X0 + 112 + t.bps * 9 + 8} y={245 + i * 24} class="f-qty"><tspan data-lang-en>{t.bps.toFixed(1)}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{t.bps.toFixed(1).replace('.', ',')}</tspan> bp<tspan class="f-faint" dx="10"><tspan data-lang-en>step {t.tick} VND</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bước {t.tick} đồng</tspan></tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The grid is coarse for a stock priced just above 10,000: one step is half a percent. Between 25,000 and 100,000 dong it is 10 to 20 basis points, which is wide next to the move a short-horizon model hopes to predict.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lưới giá khá thô với cổ phiếu vừa vượt 10.000 đồng: một bước là nửa phần trăm. Trong khoảng 25.000 đến 100.000 đồng, bước giá là 10 đến 20 điểm cơ bản, rộng so với mức dịch chuyển mà một mô hình ngắn hạn muốn đoán.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .f .f-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .f .f-price { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-qty { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-faint { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; }
  .f .f-ann { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-ann.is-ask, .f .f-ann.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .f .f-ann.is-bid, .f .f-ann.is-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .f .f-ann.is-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .f .f-mid-t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f-ask { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-bid { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--act-2) 16%, var(--bg)); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-empty { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-gone { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-mid { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .f-lead { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .f-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-card { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-arrow { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .f-grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
